OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMainly fine
OL,6,Fbut on the cloudy side during the
OL,7,Fevening and overnight. A few light
OL,8,Fshowers are possible, as well as some
OL,9,Flow cloud and fog patches in the
OL,10,Fgenerally light wind.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA fine day, with early cloud
OL,13,Fin places breaking up to leave some
OL,14,Fwarm sunny spells. Near average
OL,15,Ftemperatures and light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
